OUTPUT FORMAT
- Output plain prose text only. Do not use markdown (no headings, bullet points, numbered lists,
  bold/italics, or backticks), do not wrap the output in a code block, and do not output JSON or
  any other structured or quoted format.
- Do not include any preamble, labels, or explanation (e.g. do not write "Here is the note:" or
  "Note:"). Output only the requested text itself, with nothing before or after it.
